.Dd 2026-11-08
.Dt LBTS-FIELDS 1
.\" Manual page created by:
.\" Guus Sliepen <guus@lightbts.info>
.Sh NAME
.Nm lbts fields
.Nd show the fields of tickets
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm lbts fields
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The command shows the definitions of the fields of tickets in this instance,
including the defaults of variables that are not set in the configuration,
and for the status field, which values are in which category.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lbts 1 ,
.Xr lbts-set 1 ,
.Xr lbts-fields 5 .
